
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Store</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }
    h1 { color: #222; }
    p { color: #666; }
    .product {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 350px;
      margin: 30px auto;
    }
    button {
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome to My Store</h1>
  <p>Simple products. Great prices.</p>

  <div class="product">
    <h2>USB-C Braided Cable</h2>
    <p>Durable braided charging cable.</p>
    <h2>€6.99</h2>
    <button onclick="alert('Product details coming soon!')">
      View Product
    </button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
